1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:00,962
Cinco minutitos…

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,603
¡Eso dijiste ayer!

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,571
¡No! ¡Hoy es domingo!

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,447
¡Es lunes!

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,027
